{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04121","headline":"赠温驸马汝阳王 · 徐晶","name":"赠温驸马汝阳王","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"畴昔承余论，文章幸滥推。\n夜陪银汉赏，朝奉桂山词。\n梁邸调歌日，秦楼按舞时。\n登高频作赋，体物屡爲诗。\n连骑长楸下，浮觞曲水湄。\n北堂留上客，南陌送佳期。\n忆昨陪临泛，于今阻宴私。\n再看冬雪满，三见夏花滋。\n都尉朝青阁，淮王侍紫墀。\n宁知倦游者，华髪老京师。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"徐晶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04121.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04121","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}